  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Adds an optional launch_handler manifest entry, so an installed app can focus or navigate an existing window instead of opening a new one. Off unless configured, so upgrading changes nothing on its own. Concurrent install reports are now database-safe, and the dashboard summary is aggregated in SQL. Full changelog: https://github.com/BaryoDev/umbraco-pwa/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
